{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R4sVbum6Z2hkKgDREhPJ9b","type":"tool_result","content":"180\t  slots: TableSlot[];            // 菜品槽位列表\n181\t  totalTimeMinutes: number;      // 预估烹饪时间\n182\t  createdAt: number;\n183\t}\n184\t```\n185\t\n186\t---\n187\t\n188\t## 四、 数据库 Schema 设计 (CloudBase Collections)\n189\t\n190\t### 4.1 集合清单\n191\t1. **`dishes`**：菜品库（云端权威数据源，只读/管理员可写）。\n192\t2. **`ingredients`**：时令食材字典库。\n193\t3. **`users`**：用户基本信息（微信 OpenID、昵称、注册时间）。\n194\t4. **`preferences`**：用户口味、辣度、忌口与默认设置。\n195\t5. **`meal_history`**：用户正式确认开饭的就餐历史。\n196\t6. **`favorites`**：用户收藏菜品。\n197\t\n198\t### 4.2 核心集合字段规格\n199\t\n200\t#### `preferences` 集合\n201\t```json\n202\t{\n203\t  \"_id\": \"pref_openid_xxxx\",\n204\t  \"_openid\": \"wx_openid_12345\",\n205\t  \"peopleCount\": 2,\n206\t  \"defaultMealMode\": \"hearty_3_1\",\n207\t  \"spicyLevel\": 1,\n208\t  \"dislikedIngredients\": [\"香菜\", \"羊肉\", \"苦瓜\", \"内脏\"],\n209\t  \"favoriteCategories\": [\"main_meat\", \"vegetable\"],\n210\t  \"blockedDishIds\": [\"dish_089\"],\n211\t  \"region\": \"川渝\",\n212\t  \"updatedAt\": 1727236800000\n213\t}\n214\t```\n215\t\n216\t#### `meal_history` 集合\n217\t```json\n218\t{\n219\t  \"_id\": \"hist_20260925_xxxx\",\n220\t  \"_openid\": \"wx_openid_12345\",\n221\t  \"date\": \"2026-09-25\",\n222\t  \"dishIds\": [\"dish_001\", \"dish_015\", \"dish_042\", \"dish_078\"],\n223\t  \"mealMode\": \"hearty_3_1\",\n224\t  \"createdAt\": 1727236800000\n225\t}\n226\t```\n227\t\n228\t---\n229\t\n230\t## 五、 推荐算法引擎架构设计 (`menuRecommendation.ts`)\n231\t\n232\t```\n233\t                  ┌──────────────────────┐\n234\t                  │ 菜品全库 (200道家常菜) │\n235\t                  └──────────┬───────────┘\n236\t                             │\n237\t                             ▼\n238\t         [ 阶段一：硬过滤管道 (Hard Filter Pipeline) ]\n239\t         • 排除启用状态为 false 的菜品"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbd1474c-773c-4640-b863-6a85e2236161","uuid":"f92fdf00-44da-4ad6-ab13-c6822eb797a9","timestamp":"2026-10-02T10:46:29.674Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/zhuangxiji/Desktop/CC/一日三餐/docs/technical-design.md","content":"  slots: TableSlot[];            // 菜品槽位列表\n  totalTimeMinutes: number;      // 预估烹饪时间\n  createdAt: number;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 四、 数据库 Schema 设计 (CloudBase Collections)\n\n### 4.1 集合清单\n1. **`dishes`**：菜品库（云端权威数据源，只读/管理员可写）。\n2. **`ingredients`**：时令食材字典库。\n3. **`users`**：用户基本信息（微信 OpenID、昵称、注册时间）。\n4. **`preferences`**：用户口味、辣度、忌口与默认设置。\n5. **`meal_history`**：用户正式确认开饭的就餐历史。\n6. **`favorites`**：用户收藏菜品。\n\n### 4.2 核心集合字段规格\n\n#### `preferences` 集合\n```json\n{\n  \"_id\": \"pref_openid_xxxx\",\n  \"_openid\": \"wx_openid_12345\",\n  \"peopleCount\": 2,\n  \"defaultMealMode\": \"hearty_3_1\",\n  \"spicyLevel\": 1,\n  \"dislikedIngredients\": [\"香菜\", \"羊肉\", \"苦瓜\", \"内脏\"],\n  \"favoriteCategories\": [\"main_meat\", \"vegetable\"],\n  \"blockedDishIds\": [\"dish_089\"],\n  \"region\": \"川渝\",\n  \"updatedAt\": 1727236800000\n}\n```\n\n#### `meal_history` 集合\n```json\n{\n  \"_id\": \"hist_20260925_xxxx\",\n  \"_openid\": \"wx_openid_12345\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-09-25\",\n  \"dishIds\": [\"dish_001\", \"dish_015\", \"dish_042\", \"dish_078\"],\n  \"mealMode\": \"hearty_3_1\",\n  \"createdAt\": 1727236800000\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 五、 推荐算法引擎架构设计 (`menuRecommendation.ts`)\n\n```\n                  ┌──────────────────────┐\n                  │ 菜品全库 (200道家常菜) │\n                  └──────────┬───────────┘\n                             │\n                             ▼\n         [ 阶段一：硬过滤管道 (Hard Filter Pipeline) ]\n         • 排除启用状态为 false 的菜品","numLines":60,"startLine":180,"totalLines":331}}}
